retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:592add8a-cec4-42ca-bf87-9a8ded2536fc] @ 2026-08-24T10:20:50.713135+00:00

The Mono-Means-Data Rule. Monospace is for identifiers, data, and measurements — never as a costume for 'technical'. Prose is always sans. (DESIGN.md §typography)
---
[node:a59c22d9-b05c-42db-9bb4-fae620f871ca]
