needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:592add8a-cec4-42ca-bf87-9a8ded2536fc] @ 2026-08-24T10:20:50.945712+00:00

The Flat-Until-Touched Rule. A surface is flat at rest. Shadow appears as a response to hover, focus, or the toast — never as static decoration. (DESIGN.md §elevation)
---
[node:5c8af8b3-7d96-42fb-b89e-b54e96cdb2f3]
type: constraint
tier: mid-term
path: /artifact/the-name-first-rule-in-any-id-type
created_at: 2026-08-24T10:20:51.185931+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:592add8a-cec4-42ca-bf87-9a8ded2536fc] @ 2026-08-24T10:20:51.185931+00:00

The Name-First Rule. In any id · type · name line, the human-meaningful name is the darkest, largest-weight token; ids and types recede to muted mono. (DESIGN.md §components)
---
[node:4cb39abe-8176-4943-907d-8da7ca2eeef7]
type: constraint
tier: mid-term
path: /artifact/the-persisted-chrome-rule-drawer-width
created_at: 2026-08-24T10:20:51.438406+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:592add8a-cec4-42ca-bf87-9a8ded2536fc] @ 2026-08-24T10:20:51.438406+00:00

The Persisted-Chrome Rule. Drawer width and dock side are user state, not layout defaults — remember them across opens, never reset them on navigation. (DESIGN.md §components)
---
[node:7fa594bb-991d-4969-a993-1429c0ff95c4]
