archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:592add8a-cec4-42ca-bf87-9a8ded2536fc] @ 2026-08-24T10:20:51.684406+00:00

The One-Hue-Per-Category Rule. Map edge types and status onto the existing semantic tokens (accent/ok/warn/danger) and differentiate with drawn icons; never invent a new hue for a category. (DESIGN.md §colors)
---
